      "gloss": "undo the buttons",
      "comment": "A description of ours: the counterpart of Traupman’s <span lang=\"la\">globulīs stringere</span> for doing buttons up (see “button up”), with <span lang=\"la\">solvere</span>, the plain verb for undoing a knot or a fastening. We have found no word for unbuttoning in Traupman, Morgan–Owens, or Levi–Bini."
